    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there's \"support\" but it doesn't change the fact that the part of me that actually mattered is dead. it's like i'm just walking around as a ghost. it's not just sadness, it's like my entire purpose is just... gone. i'm just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to them.",
